{"seq":1,"slug":"payout-status-tracking","title":"出款状态回拉与追踪","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/global-seller-payout-orchestration/status-return-reconcile/payout-status-tracking","wordCount":3175,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"出款状态回拉与追踪\">出款状态回拉与追踪</h1><p>一笔 ACH 出款提交后，本地可以得到一个确定的结果：文件已生成、已提交、合作方返回了受理确认。但这个结果回答的只是「指令发出去了」，而不是「钱到了」。真正决定这笔出款成败的证据要在一到三个工作日后才出现——可能在合作方的 webhook 里，可能在主动查询的响应里，最晚在日终的对账文件里。<strong>状态回拉与追踪要做的就是把这个「提交之后、到账之前」的空白期填满，让每一笔出款在任何时刻都有一个明确的、可解释的状态，而不是一个「已提交，后续未知」的黑洞。</strong></p>\n<p>这个空白期在工程上有三个具体的困难。第一是<strong>信息源不可靠</strong>：webhook 会丢、查询接口会超时、文件会延迟，任何单一来源都不能被信任。第二是<strong>状态词汇不对齐</strong>：合作方说 <code>PROCESSING</code>，它的含义介于「已受理未清算」和「已进入网络」之间，而你的状态机里可能没有对应的状态。第三是<strong>悬空识别的阈值没有客观依据</strong>：「这笔出款三天没动」到底是正常的（跨境电汇常常如此）还是异常的（合作方系统故障）？把这三个困难处理掉，状态追踪才算建成。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"三个信息源及其失效模式\">三个信息源及其失效模式</h3><p>状态信息只有三个来源，它们的可靠性、时效与失效模式各不相同，理解失效模式比理解正常路径更重要。</p>\n<p><strong>被动回调（webhook）</strong> 是最及时的来源，正常情形下状态变更在秒级到分钟级到达。它的失效模式有四种：回调服务重启期间的推送被丢弃、回调处理逻辑抛异常导致 200 未返回而使对方重试耗尽、签名校验失败被误判为无效请求、以及对方压根没实现某些状态的推送（只推终态不推中间态）。因此 webhook 只能是<strong>加速收敛</strong>的手段，不能是唯一手段。</p>\n<p><strong>主动查询（polling）</strong> 是兜底。它的失效模式包括：接口限流（高频轮询被拒）、状态滞后（合作方自己也还没收到上游确认）、以及最隐蔽的一种——<strong>查询接口返回的状态是「最新快照」而不是「事件序列」</strong>。这意味着如果你中间漏掉了一次状态变更，你无法从查询结果里知道「它经过了哪些状态」，只能知道「它现在是什么」。所以查询适合收敛终态，不适合重建历史。</p>\n<p><strong>日终对账文件</strong> 是最权威的来源，它包含合作方对当日全部处理结果的完整陈述。它的失效模式是延迟（次日才可得）与格式问题（字段变更、编码问题、控制号不符）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>信息源</th>\n<th>时效</th>\n<th>可靠性</th>\n<th>主要失效模式</th>\n<th>正确用法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>webhook</td>\n<td>秒–分钟</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>丢失、重放、漏推中间态</td>\n<td>加速收敛</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主动查询</td>\n<td>秒–分钟</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>限流、状态滞后、只有快照</td>\n<td>收敛终态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对账文件</td>\n<td>次日</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>延迟、格式变更</td>\n<td>权威兜底与差错发现</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"状态词汇的对齐\">状态词汇的对齐</h3><p>合作方给的状态词不能直接进你的状态机。正确做法是维护一张<strong>映射表</strong>，把每个合作方的词汇映射到本地规范状态，并显式处理三类不完美映射。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;partner&quot;: &quot;ach_partner_a&quot;,&#10;  &quot;status_mapping&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;external&quot;: &quot;RECEIVED&quot;, &quot;local&quot;: &quot;accepted&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;external&quot;: &quot;VALIDATED&quot;, &quot;local&quot;: &quot;accepted&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;external&quot;: &quot;BATCHED&quot;, &quot;local&quot;: &quot;in_flight&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;external&quot;: &quot;SENT_TO_NETWORK&quot;, &quot;local&quot;: &quot;in_flight&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;external&quot;: &quot;SETTLED&quot;, &quot;local&quot;: &quot;settled&quot;, &quot;terminal&quot;: true },&#10;    { &quot;external&quot;: &quot;COMPLETED&quot;, &quot;local&quot;: &quot;settled&quot;, &quot;terminal&quot;: true },&#10;    { &quot;external&quot;: &quot;RETURNED&quot;, &quot;local&quot;: &quot;returned&quot;, &quot;terminal&quot;: false },&#10;    { &quot;external&quot;: &quot;REJECTED&quot;, &quot;local&quot;: &quot;rejected&quot;, &quot;terminal&quot;: true },&#10;    { &quot;external&quot;: &quot;CANCELLED&quot;, &quot;local&quot;: &quot;rejected&quot;, &quot;terminal&quot;: true }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;unmapped_policy&quot;: &quot;quarantine&quot;,&#10;  &quot;regression_policy&quot;: &quot;never_move_backward_except_returned&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"partner\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ach_partner_a\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"status_mapping\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"external\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"RECEIVED\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"local\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"accepted\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"external\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"VALIDATED\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"local\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"accepted\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"external\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"BATCHED\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"local\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"in_flight\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"external\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SENT_TO_NETWORK\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"local\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"in_flight\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"external\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SETTLED\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"local\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"settled\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"terminal\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"external\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"COMPLETED\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"local\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"settled\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"terminal\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"external\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"RETURNED\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"local\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"returned\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"terminal\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"external\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"REJECTED\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"local\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"rejected\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"terminal\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"external\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CANCELLED\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"local\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"rejected\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"terminal\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"unmapped_policy\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"quarantine\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"regression_policy\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"never_move_backward_except_returned\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三类不完美映射必须显式处理。<strong>多对一映射</strong>（<code>RECEIVED</code> 与 <code>VALIDATED</code> 都映射到 <code>accepted</code>）会导致「本地状态没变化但收到了两次事件」，处理方式是让状态推进基于目标状态比较而不是无条件推进——相同状态的事件被吸收而不是重复计数。<strong>未映射词汇</strong>必须进隔离队列并告警，绝不能默认映射到某个状态（默认映射会把合作方新增的状态静默地错解释）。<strong>状态回退</strong>需要特别规则：正常情况下状态不应回退，但 <code>returned</code> 是一个合法的「从已结算回退到退回」的转移，所以规则要写成「除非目标状态是 returned，否则不回退」。</p>\n<h3 id=\"单调推进与事件序列\">单调推进与事件序列</h3><p>状态追踪的一个核心不变量是<strong>单调性</strong>：一条出款的状态推进不应无故回退。但收不到事件时，用查询结果去「修正」本地状态可能造成回退——因为查询是快照。处理方式是维护一个显式的状态序（用数值表示推进阶段），只允许向更大的序推进：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 状态序：数值越大越靠后；returned 单独处理&#10;CREATE TABLE payout_status_rank (&#10;  status      TEXT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  rank        SMALLINT NOT NULL,&#10;  is_terminal BOOLEAN  NOT NULL&#10;);&#10;&#10;INSERT INTO payout_status_rank VALUES&#10;  (&#39;created&#39;, 10, false), (&#39;queued&#39;, 20, false), (&#39;submitting&#39;, 30, false),&#10;  (&#39;unknown&#39;, 40, false), (&#39;accepted&#39;, 50, false), (&#39;in_flight&#39;, 60, false),&#10;  (&#39;settled&#39;, 100, true), (&#39;rejected&#39;, 100, true), (&#39;resolved&#39;, 100, true);&#10;&#10;-- 事件表：只追加，是状态的权威历史&#10;CREATE TABLE payout_status_event (&#10;  event_id       BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  payout_item_id BIGINT      NOT NULL,&#10;  source         TEXT        NOT NULL,     -- webhook / poll / file / manual / reconciler&#10;  external_status TEXT,                    -- 原始词汇，保留以支持审计与回溯映射&#10;  local_status   TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;  external_ref   TEXT,&#10;  occurred_at    TIMESTAMPTZ,              -- 外部事件时间（若合作方提供）&#10;  received_at    TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  raw_payload    JSONB       NOT NULL,&#10;  dedup_key      TEXT        NOT NULL,     -- source + external_ref + external_status + 时间窗&#10;  UNIQUE (dedup_key)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 状态序：数值越大越靠后；returned 单独处理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> payout_status_rank</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rank        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SMALLINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  is_terminal </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BOOLEAN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> payout_status_rank </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'created'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, false), (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'queued'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, false), (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'submitting'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, false),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'unknown'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">40</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, false), (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'accepted'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, false), (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'in_flight'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">60</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, false),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'settled'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, true), (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'rejected'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, true), (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'resolved'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, true);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 事件表：只追加，是状态的权威历史</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> payout_status_event</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  event_id       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  payout_item_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  source         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,     </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- webhook / poll / file / manual / reconciler</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  external_status </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,                    </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 原始词汇，保留以支持审计与回溯映射</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  local_status   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  external_ref   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  occurred_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,              </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 外部事件时间（若合作方提供）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  received_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  raw_payload    JSONB       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  dedup_key      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,     </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- source + external_ref + external_status + 时间窗</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (dedup_key)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>payout_status_event</code> 上的 <code>dedup_key</code> 是处理 webhook 重放的关键：合作方通常会重试推送（因为它不确定你是否收到），所以同一个状态事件可能到达多次。去重键应当由「来源 + 外部引用 + 外部状态 + 一个粗粒度时间窗」构成——只用前三个会在「状态从 accepted 变回 accepted 再变回来」这种边界上误去重，加上时间窗能避免这一点。</p>\n<p><code>local_status</code> 是从 <code>external_status</code> 映射来的，但<strong>映射关系可能随时间变化</strong>（合作方改了词汇、你改了映射），所以事件表必须保留原始词汇，否则历史事件的解释会漂移。</p>\n<h2 id=\"轮询设计\">轮询设计</h2><h3 id=\"只轮询非终态\">只轮询非终态</h3><p>轮询最基础的原则是<strong>只轮询非终态</strong>。终态出款（settled、rejected、resolved）不需要任何进一步的查询，它们的后续只由对账文件校验。把终态排除在轮询范围外，能把轮询量降低一个数量级（大多数出款会在几天内到达终态，存量中非终态的比例通常很小）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"分层轮询与退避\">分层轮询与退避</h3><p>非终态出款按状态分层轮询，每层的间隔反映「这个状态下有意思的变化有多快」：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>状态</th>\n<th>轮询间隔</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>submitting</td>\n<td>10–30 秒</td>\n<td>提交结果应在秒级可得</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>unknown</td>\n<td>30 秒 → 1 小时（指数退避）</td>\n<td>早期快速收敛，后期不浪费配额</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>accepted</td>\n<td>15–60 分钟</td>\n<td>状态变化以小时计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>in_flight</td>\n<td>1–4 小时</td>\n<td>清算通常在数小时到数日</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>returned</td>\n<td>6–24 小时</td>\n<td>等待冲正完成</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>退避的实现要注意<strong>每笔出款有自己的退避进度</strong>，而不是全局一个间隔。用一个 <code>next_poll_at</code> 字段记录每笔的下次轮询时间，由扫描器批量取出到期的记录，这样即使某笔出款长期悬空，它占用的是一个低频槽位而不是持续的高频请求。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 轮询任务选取：按状态分层，取到期且未超上限的条目&#10;WITH ranked AS (&#10;  SELECT p.payout_item_id, p.status, p.next_poll_at, p.poll_attempts,&#10;         ROW_NUMBER() OVER (PARTITION BY p.status ORDER BY p.next_poll_at) AS rn&#10;    FROM payout_item p&#10;   WHERE p.status NOT IN (&#39;settled&#39;, &#39;rejected&#39;, &#39;resolved&#39;)&#10;     AND p.next_poll_at &lt;= now()&#10;     AND p.poll_attempts &lt; 200&#10;     AND p.partner_id = $1&#10;)&#10;SELECT * FROM ranked&#10; WHERE rn &lt;= CASE status&#10;               WHEN &#39;submitting&#39; THEN 500&#10;               WHEN &#39;unknown&#39;    THEN 200&#10;               WHEN &#39;accepted&#39;   THEN 100&#10;               WHEN &#39;in_flight&#39;  THEN 50&#10;               WHEN &#39;returned&#39;   THEN 20&#10;               ELSE 10 END;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 轮询任务选取：按状态分层，取到期且未超上限的条目</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ranked </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">payout_item_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">next_poll_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">poll_attempts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         ROW_NUMBER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">next_poll_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> payout_item p</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'settled'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'rejected'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'resolved'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">next_poll_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">poll_attempts</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 200</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">partner_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ranked</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">               WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'submitting'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 500</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">               WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'unknown'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 200</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">               WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'accepted'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">               WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'in_flight'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 50</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">               WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'returned'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 20</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">               ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>对每个分层设配额不只是限流礼貌，它还保证了<strong>配额被按紧急程度分配</strong>：如果合作方接口一天只允许 10 万次调用，把配额按状态重要性切分比「先到先轮询」更能保证关键状态被及时收敛。</p>\n<h3 id=\"查询接口的语义限制\">查询接口的语义限制</h3><p>轮询实现时必须确认三件事，否则设计会有系统性偏差：</p>\n<p><strong>查询是否幂等、是否有副作用</strong>。绝大多数状态查询是只读的，但少数合作方的「查询」接口在未收到结果时会触发一次内部推进（这被称为查询触发处理），这种情况下高频查询反而会加快状态变化，轮询间隔的设计要与合作方确认。</p>\n<p><strong>查询结果是否有时间语义</strong>。返回的「状态时间」是事件发生时间还是状态确认时间？两者的差别在跨境场景下可能是一天。</p>\n<p><strong>查询是否有结果数上限</strong>。有些合作方支持批量查询（一次传多个引用），有些不支持。批量查询能极大降低调用量，但它往往返回的是简化结果（只有状态没有详情），所以通常的做法是<strong>批量查询发现变化、单笔查询取详情</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"悬空识别与升级\">悬空识别与升级</h2><h3 id=\"悬空阈值的依据\">悬空阈值的依据</h3><p>「卡住了」不能靠拍一个「超过 24 小时就算异常」的阈值，因为合理的时效本来就因 rail 而异——实时 rail 的十分钟异常与跨境电汇的三天正常是同一件事的不同尺度。所以阈值必须由<strong>历史分布</strong>给出，而不是常数。</p>\n<p>具体做法是按 rail × 走廊 × 金额区间统计历史「从进入某状态到离开该状态」的时长分布，取一个高分位数（如 95 分位）作为告警阈值、取更高分位（如 99 分位）作为升级阈值。这样阈值的语义是「超过这个时长的出款比同类出款中的 95% 都慢」，它对异常敏感且随业务变化自动调整。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mn>99</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mn>0.99</mn></msub><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>:</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>历史出款</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_{99}(r, c) = \\mathrm{Quantile}_{0.99}\\left\\{ \\Delta t_i : i \\in \\text{历史出款}(r, c) \\right\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">99</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Quantile</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0.99</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">历史出款</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>阈值必须<strong>定期重算</strong>（例如每周），因为业务结构在变——新开通一个市场的首批出款会很慢（因为合作方在磨合），把这个慢纳入基线后阈值会放宽，这确实是合理的（新的正常）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"升级的分级动作\">升级的分级动作</h3><p>悬空识别的产出不是一个告警，而是一个<strong>分级处置</strong>：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[悬空检测扫描] --&gt; B{超过告警阈值?}&#10;    B --&gt;|否| Z[继续正常轮询]&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C[提高轮询频率&lt;br/&gt;并标记疑似悬空]&#10;    C --&gt; D{超过升级阈值?}&#10;    D --&gt;|否| Z&#10;    D --&gt;|是| E{合作方是否已知故障?}&#10;    E --&gt;|是| F[关联故障单&lt;br/&gt;批量标记, 不再逐个告警]&#10;    E --&gt;|否| G[创建人工差错单&lt;br/&gt;附状态历史与查询记录]&#10;    G --&gt; H[人工核查: 查询合作方后台&lt;br/&gt;或联系对接人]&#10;    H --&gt; I{确认结果}&#10;    I --&gt;|已受理| J[补齐 external_ref&lt;br/&gt;推进状态]&#10;    I --&gt;|未受理| K[走重发流程&lt;br/&gt;新 attempt, 见 3/2]&#10;    I --&gt;|无法确定| L[保持悬空&lt;br/&gt;升级至合作方管理层]\">graph TD\n    A[悬空检测扫描] --&gt; B{超过告警阈值?}\n    B --&gt;|否| Z[继续正常轮询]\n    B --&gt;|是| C[提高轮询频率&lt;br/&gt;并标记疑似悬空]\n    C --&gt; D{超过升级阈值?}\n    D --&gt;|否| Z\n    D --&gt;|是| E{合作方是否已知故障?}\n    E --&gt;|是| F[关联故障单&lt;br/&gt;批量标记, 不再逐个告警]\n    E --&gt;|否| G[创建人工差错单&lt;br/&gt;附状态历史与查询记录]\n    G --&gt; H[人工核查: 查询合作方后台&lt;br/&gt;或联系对接人]\n    H --&gt; I{确认结果}\n    I --&gt;|已受理| J[补齐 external_ref&lt;br/&gt;推进状态]\n    I --&gt;|未受理| K[走重发流程&lt;br/&gt;新 attempt, 见 3/2]\n    I --&gt;|无法确定| L[保持悬空&lt;br/&gt;升级至合作方管理层]</pre><p>两个细节很重要。<strong>E 分支（合作方已知故障）是降低告警噪声的关键</strong>：当合作方整个系统故障时，会有成千上万笔出款同时悬空，逐个创建差错单会淹没运营。正确做法是维护一个「合作方故障状态」，在故障期间把受影响的悬空批次归并成一个故障单，故障恢复后统一调和。<strong>L 分支（无法确定）必须存在</strong>：现实中确实存在「合作方也说不清」的情形，此时保持悬空并升级到更高层是唯一诚实的处理，而不是强行推进一个状态。</p>\n<h3 id=\"状态追踪的可观测性\">状态追踪的可观测性</h3><p>状态追踪系统本身需要被观测，否则它失效时你不会知道。四个必需的指标：</p>\n<p><strong>状态分布与时长</strong>：按 rail 与状态统计在途笔数与平均停留时长。某个状态的停留时长突然变长，是合作方或网络问题的第一信号。</p>\n<p><strong>信息源贡献比</strong>：终态收敛分别由 webhook、查询、对账文件贡献的比例。webhook 贡献比突然下降意味着回调服务有问题，即使一切看起来正常。</p>\n<p><strong>未映射词汇计数</strong>：<code>quarantine</code> 队列的长度。非零就意味着有合作方状态词没被正确处理。</p>\n<p><strong>悬空率</strong>：悬空笔数 / 非终态笔数。这是状态追踪系统健康度的最直接指标，它同时反映了合作方可靠性与自身调和能力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>状态证据只有三个来源：webhook（及时但会丢）、主动查询（兜底但只有快照）、对账文件（权威但延迟），任何单一来源都不能被信任。</li>\n<li>合作方状态词必须经映射表进入本地状态机，未映射词汇进隔离队列而非默认映射；多对一映射要靠「按目标状态比较」吸收重复事件。</li>\n<li>状态推进应当单调（用状态序 + 只向大序推进），<code>returned</code> 是唯一的合法回退；事件表只追加并保留原始外部词汇，因为映射关系会变。</li>\n<li>事件去重键必须包含时间窗，否则「状态短期内重复变化」会被错误去重。</li>\n<li>轮询只针对非终态，按状态分层并逐笔退避（每笔有自己的下次轮询时间）；分层配额保证限流下关键状态优先收敛。</li>\n<li>轮询实现前必须确认查询的副作用、时间语义与批量能力；常见组合是「批量查询发现变化 + 单笔查询取详情」。</li>\n<li>悬空阈值必须由按 rail × 走廊 × 金额区间统计的历史分位数给出并定期重算，而不是拍常数。</li>\n<li>悬空处置必须分级：提频 → 关联合作方故障单（避免告警淹没） → 人工差错单 → 保持悬空并升级；必须保留「无法确定」这一诚实分支。</li>\n<li>状态追踪自身需要指标：状态时长分布、信息源贡献比、未映射词汇计数、悬空率。</li>\n<li>到达终态的出款并不等于事情结束，退回与冲正的处理在下一节（见 <a href=\"return-reversal-chargeback\">退回、拒付与冲正</a>），而权威兜底来自对账（见 <a href=\"payout-reconcile-notify\">出款对账与商家通知</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"出款状态回拉与追踪","id":"出款状态回拉与追踪"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"三个信息源及其失效模式","id":"三个信息源及其失效模式"},{"level":3,"text":"状态词汇的对齐","id":"状态词汇的对齐"},{"level":3,"text":"单调推进与事件序列","id":"单调推进与事件序列"},{"level":2,"text":"轮询设计","id":"轮询设计"},{"level":3,"text":"只轮询非终态","id":"只轮询非终态"},{"level":3,"text":"分层轮询与退避","id":"分层轮询与退避"},{"level":3,"text":"查询接口的语义限制","id":"查询接口的语义限制"},{"level":2,"text":"悬空识别与升级","id":"悬空识别与升级"},{"level":3,"text":"悬空阈值的依据","id":"悬空阈值的依据"},{"level":3,"text":"升级的分级动作","id":"升级的分级动作"},{"level":3,"text":"状态追踪的可观测性","id":"状态追踪的可观测性"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"资金冻结与释放","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/global-seller-payout-orchestration/batch-payout-execution/balance-hold-release"},"next":{"title":"退回、拒付与冲正","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/global-seller-payout-orchestration/status-return-reconcile/return-reversal-chargeback"}}